Subject: [PATCH 8/9] geph5-app: overridable PAC port in supervisor.rs

PAC_ADDR was a const binding the PAC endpoint to 127.0.0.1:12223. With two
installs on one device (the root module and a Termux service) both would try
to bind it and the second would fail. pac_addr() reads GEPH5_PAC_PORT
instead, falling back to 12223; the Termux sv service exports
GEPH5_PAC_PORT=12233 (sv-run.sh template in android/termux/).

Small file, additive change, no cfg logic: fragile only if upstream reworks
the PAC constant itself.
